  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Plan initiation Resilient Opportunities for Recovery and Transition</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">To support the shift from emergency response to recovery, the project will reinforce coordination capacities for early recovery at sub-national levels, linking displacement solutions, institutional revitalization, and area-based programming. This positions early recovery as the foundation for sustainable transitions, guided by a Nexus-aligned approach</narrative>
  </description>
